  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for evaluation and methodological issues (2017 - 2018)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Funding for evaluation and methodological issues (2017 - 2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mindre summor f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till konferenser, studier, specialrapporter och workshops bokf&#xf6;rs under detta bidrag. Vidare faktureras bidraget &#xe4;ven f&#xf6;r eng&#xe5;ngskostnader inom v&#xe5;ra ramavtal med revisionsbyr&#xe5;er (s&#xe5; kallade call-off contracts). Den fungerar d&#xe4;rmed som en &#x201d;strategisk fond&#x201d;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smaller amounts of support for such activities as conferences, studies, special reports and workshops are to recorded under this     contribution. Also, call-off orders made within our framework agreements with audit firms are charged to this contribution. It works as a &quot;strategic fund&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
